Troubleshooting Tips
Issue: Cuckoo fails to start

Solution: Check PostgreSQL is running: sudo systemctl status postgresql
Verify database connection in ~/.cuckoo/conf/cuckoo.conf
Issue: Cannot submit samples

Solution: Ensure Cuckoo web interface is running on port 8090
Check API endpoint: curl http://127.0.0.1:8090/tasks/list
Issue: Analysis times out

Solution: Increase timeout in configuration
Verify VM network connectivity to host
Issue: No network traffic captured

Solution: Check tcpdump permissions: getcap /usr/sbin/tcpdump
Verify host-only network configuration
